msgstr "Foloseste Rufus MBR"

#. • MSG_350
msgid "Use 'Windows CA 2023' signed bootloaders (Requires a compatible target PC)"
msgstr "Foloseste bootloadere semnate cu 'Windows CA 2023' (necesita un PC compatibil)"

#. • MSG_351
