#. • MSG_523
msgid "A USB drive of 16 GB or larger was detected. Formatting it as ext2 or ext3 could take a very long time (about 30 minutes).\n\nDo you want to continue?"
msgstr "A fost detectata o unitate USB de 16 GB sau mai mare. Formatarea acesteia ca ext2 sau ext3 poate dura foarte mult (aproximativ 30 de minute).\n\nDoriti sa continuati?"

#. • MSG_524
msgid "This image uses GRUB %s, but Rufus only includes files for GRUB %s.\n\nThe required files could not be downloaded. Rufus will use the included version instead."
msgstr "Aceasta imagine utilizeaza GRUB %s, dar Rufus include numai fisierele pentru GRUB %s.\n\nFisierele necesare nu au putut fi descarcate. Rufus va utiliza in schimb versiunea inclusa."

